
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>면접 시뮬레이터 - AI와 함께하는 완벽한 면접 연습</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'blue-400': '#60a5fa',
                        'blue-500': '#3b82f6',
                        'purple-500': '#a855f7'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .gradient-bg {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa 0%, #3b82f6 50%, #a855f7 100%);
        }
        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe 0%, #e9d5ff 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }
        .gradient-button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa 0%, #a855f7 100%);
        }
        .gradient-icon {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa 0%, #a855f7 100%);
        }
        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
        }
        .fade-in-delay {
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }
        .fade-in-delay-2 {
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out 0.4s both;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .hover-scale:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }
        .hover-shadow:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }
        .hover-translate:hover {
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }
        .bg-decoration {
            position: absolute;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .bg-decoration-1 {
            top: 25%;
            left: 25%;
            width: 16rem;
            height: 16rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(3rem);
        }
        .bg-decoration-2 {
            top: 75%;
            right: 25%;
            width: 24rem;
            height: 24rem;
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(3rem);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-white">
<!-- Header -->
<header class="relative z-10">
    <nav class="container mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 fade-in">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 gradient-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">면접 시뮬레이터</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8 fade-in">
            <a href="#features" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 transition-colors">기능</a>
            <a href="#testimonials" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 transition-colors">후기</a>
            <button class="gradient-button text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full hover-shadow transition-all">
                시작하기
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>
</header>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20">
    <!-- Blue Background Area -->
    <div class="w-full gradient-bg py-16 mb-16 relative overflow-hidden fade-in">
        <!-- Background decoration -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
            <div class="bg-decoration bg-decoration-1"></div>
            <div class="bg-decoration bg-decoration-2"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Content Container -->
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
                AI와 함께하는
                <span class="gradient-text">
                        <br />완벽한 면접 연습
                    </span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-blue-100 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-base">
                실제 면접관처럼 질문하고 피드백하는 AI 시스템으로
                언제 어디서나 실전같은 면접 연습을 경험하세요
            </p>

            <div class="flex justify-center fade-in-delay">
                <button class="group bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover-shadow transition-all flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span>지금 시작하기</span>
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 hover-translate transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto fade-in-delay-2">
            {{#stats}}
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">{{number}}</div>
                    <div class="text-gray-600">{{label}}</div>
                </div>
            {{/stats}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Features Section -->
<section id="features" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                왜 면접 시뮬레이터인가요?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                최신 AI 기술로 실제 면접 환경을 완벽하게 재현하여
                효과적인 면접 준비를 도와드립니다
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
            {{#features}}
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 hover-shadow transition-all group fade-in">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 gradient-icon rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 hover-scale transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            {{{icon}}}
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">{{title}}</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">{{description}}</p>
                </div>
            {{/features}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- How It Works -->
<section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                이렇게 간단해요
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            {{#steps}}
                <div class="text-center relative fade-in">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 gradient-icon rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            {{{icon}}}
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">{{step}}</div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">{{title}}</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">{{description}}</p>

                    {{#showArrow}}
                        <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-10 left-full w-full">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    {{/showArrow}}
                </div>
            {{/steps}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Testimonials -->
<section id="testimonials" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                사용자들의 이야기
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            {{#testimonials}}
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm fade-in">
                    <div class="flex mb-4">
                        {{#stars}}
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
                            </svg>
                        {{/stars}}
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"{{content}}"</p>
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-gray-800">{{name}}</div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">{{role}}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/testimonials}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                지금 바로 시작하세요
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
                무료로 면접 연습을 시작하고 꿈의 직장에 한 걸음 더 가까워지세요
            </p>
            <button class="group gradient-button text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-full text-xl font-semibold hover-shadow transition-all flex items-center space-x-3 mx-auto">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>무료로 시작하기</span>
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 hover-translate transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="bg-gray-800 py-12">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4 md:mb-0">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 gradient-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">면접 시뮬레이터</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                © 2025 면접 시뮬레이터. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

<script>
    // 간단한 애니메이션 효과
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
        const observerOptions = {
            threshold: 0.1,
            rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'
        };

        const observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries) {
            entries.forEach(entry => {
                if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                    entry.target.style.opacity = '1';
                    entry.target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
                }
            });
        }, observerOptions);

        document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in, .fade-in-delay, .fade-in-delay-2').forEach(el => {
            el.style.opacity = '0';
            el.style.transform = 'translateY(20px)';
            el.style.transition = 'opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s ease-out';
            observer.observe(el);
        });
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>
